on exitFrame
  [  0] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [  2] pusharglist 1 ........................... <1>
  [  4] extcall 50 .............................. <soundBusy(1)>
  [  6] not ..................................... <not soundBusy(1)>
  [  7] jmpifz [ 17] ............................ if not soundBusy(1) then / else
  [ 10] pusharglistnoret 0 ...................... <>
  [ 12] extcall 67 .............................. play done
  [ 14] jmp [ 26]
  [ 17] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [ 18] pusharglist 1 ........................... <0>
  [ 20] extcall 2 ............................... <marker(0)>
  [ 22] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <marker(0)>
  [ 24] extcall 3 ............................... go(marker(0))
  [ 26] ret
end
